<title>USA: Madison Gas &amp; Electric Q4 results.</title>
<headline>Madison Gas &amp; Electric Q4 results.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Wis. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended Dec. 31		   1996	    1995</p>
<p> Operating revenue			   $ 72,467	$ 70,894</p>
<p> Operating income from utility opers	5,811	   8,959</p>
<p> Net income from utility opers		3,614	   5,314</p>
<p> Nonutility one-time chgs, net of tax  (12,043)		 -</p>
<p> Nonutility operating (loss)net of tax  (1,034)	   (277)</p>
<p> Net income from consolidated opers     (9,463)	   5,037</p>
<p> Earnings per share from utility oper	0.22	    0.33</p>
<p> EPS impact of one-time charges	    (0.75)		 -</p>
<p> EPS impact of operating (loss)/income   (0.06)	  (0.02)</p>
<p> Earnings per share - consolidated	 (0.59)	    0.31</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding		  16,080	  16,080</p>
<p>Twelve Months Ended Dec. 31</p>
<p> Operating revenue			    225,789	 248,590</p>
<p> Operating income from utility opers     32,913	  33,871</p>
<p> Net income from utility opers	     23,825	  22,906</p>
<p> Nonutility one-time chgs, net of tax  (12,043)		 -</p>
<p>Nonutility operating (loss)/income,</p>
<p>  net of tax				    (5,355)	   1,000</p>
