<p> Average shares outstanding		  16,080	  16,080</p>
<p>(all data in 000s except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Madson Gas said the decline in earnings is mainly due to a one-time charge to reflect investments in its gas marketing subsidiaries after a restructuring. It also had a one-time charge from a refund to natural gas customers.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
